§§ `s 13(2) -- kept after removal`

-- Arguments: how removed; day placed; Secretary applied; day applied; day asked. Placed 1 June 2026: the 3 days end on
-- 4 June (fork F10).
#ASSERT `May the Secretary still keep me` `by warrant` (`d` 1 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 3 6 2026) (`d` 10 6 2026) EQUALS `in time`
#ASSERT `May the Secretary still keep me` `by warrant` (`d` 1 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 4 6 2026) (`d` 10 6 2026) EQUALS `in time`
#ASSERT `May the Secretary still keep me` `by warrant` (`d` 1 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 5 6 2026) (`d` 10 6 2026) EQUALS `too late`
#ASSERT `May the Secretary still keep me` `by warrant` (`d` 1 6 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 4 6 2026) EQUALS `not yet`
#ASSERT `May the Secretary still keep me` `by warrant` (`d` 1 6 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 5 6 2026) EQUALS `too late`
-- An application not yet made on the day asked does not count.
#ASSERT `May the Secretary still keep me` `by warrant` (`d` 1 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 4 6 2026) (`d` 3 6 2026) EQUALS `not yet`
#ASSERT `May the Secretary still keep me` `by order` (`d` 1 6 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 30 6 2026) EQUALS `no limit`
-- Across a year end.
#ASSERT `May the Secretary still keep me` `by warrant` (`d` 30 12 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 2 1 2027) EQUALS `not yet`
#ASSERT `May the Secretary still keep me` `by warrant` (`d` 30 12 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 3 1 2027) EQUALS `too late`

