#ASSERT `Can this person seek review of the Public Guardian's decision` TRUE TRUE `someone the Tribunal considers adversely affected by the decision` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can this person seek review of the Public Guardian's decision` TRUE TRUE `someone not listed in section 80A` EQUALS NOTHING
